{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17410","headline":"顺宗至德大安孝皇帝挽歌三首 一 · 权德舆","name":"顺宗至德大安孝皇帝挽歌三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十叶开昌运，三辰丽德音。\n荐功期瘗玉，昭俭每捐金。\n解泽皇风徧，虞泉白日沈。\n仍闻起居注，焚奏感人心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}